{"schemaVersion":"1.0","source":"dataverse","table":"ppcoe_canvascontrols","exportedAtUtc":"2026-06-09T18:34:16.0435851Z","recordCount":61,"records":[{"id":"18137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"3D object","description":"Rotate and zoom into the model with simple gestures in 3D.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=18137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638893005067277551","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Avoid using if possible","recommendationCode":218650003,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-20T13:44:18Z"},{"id":"1a137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Add picture","description":"With this control users can take photos or upload image files from their device and update the data source with this content. On a mobile device the user is presented with the device's choice dialog to choose between taking a photo or selecting one already available.\n\nThis control is a grouped control containing two controls: an Image and an Add picture button. The Image control shows the uploaded image or a placeholder if no image has been uploaded. The Add picture button prompts for an image to be uploaded.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=1a137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900736907693088","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T10:43:15Z"},{"id":"1c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Address input","description":"Entering addresses can be frustrating and error-prone, particularly in mobile apps. Use the address input control to make address entry easier. The control uses fuzzy logic to suggest potential matches as you type. Select the one you want to quickly and easily enter an accurate address.\n\nThe control returns the address as structured data. Your app can extract information such as city, street, municipality, and even latitude and longitude coordinates. The data is in a format that's friendly to many locales and international address formats.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=1c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900739751940008","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T10:46:15Z"},{"id":"1e137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Attachments","description":"A control that allows users to download files to their device, as well as upload and delete files from a list created using Microsoft Lists, or a Microsoft Dataverse table.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=1e137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900746542130077","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T10:57:38Z"},{"id":"20137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Audio","description":"An Audio control plays a sound clip from a file, a recording from a Microphone control, or the audio track from a video file.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=20137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900748389200794","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T11:00:38Z"},{"id":"22137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Avatar","description":"Use the avatar control to visually represent a user, team, or entity. This control supports both image and initials formats and allows a small badge to be included to help convey status. The key properties for this control are Name and Image.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=22137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896483378058065","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Do not use","recommendationCode":218650001,"isInPreview":true,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2026-03-23T11:14:57Z"},{"id":"24137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Badge","description":"Badge can be used to display content in a visually better way. The key properties for this control are Content, Shape, and Appearance.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=24137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896413693995086","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:51Z"},{"id":"26137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Barcode reader","description":"The control opens a native scanner on Android, iOS, and Windows devices. On iOS and Android, the scanner supports the following scanning modes:\n\n- Automatically scan – A barcode is scanned as soon as it's detected.\n- Select to scan – The user can determine which of the detected barcodes to scan. The control doesn't support scanning in a web browser.\n- Scan multiple – The user can scan multiple barcodes during the barcode session.\n\nOn Windows devices, the barcode reader will always automatically scan.\n\nThe barcode reader control supports different zoom levels and turning on/off the device's flashlight from within the scanning experience.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=26137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900750488425942","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use with amendments","recommendationCode":218650002,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T11:04:08Z"},{"id":"28137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Business card reader","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Do not use","recommendationCode":218650001,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-27T13:46:17Z"},{"id":"2a137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Button","description":"A control that the user can click or tap to interact with the app.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=2a137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900752870028704","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use with amendments","recommendationCode":218650002,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T11:08:06Z"},{"id":"2c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Button","description":"Use the modern button to set a button to be primary or secondary. Configure the OnSelect property of a Button control to run one or more formulas when the user selects the control. The key properties for this control are OnSelect and Text.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=2c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896448526547837","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2026-02-05T10:20:53Z"},{"id":"2e137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Camera","description":"Use the Camera control to capture pictures with a device's camera. The device must have a camera and the user must authorise the app to use the camera.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=2e137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638900756977551711","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Do not use","recommendationCode":218650001,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T11:14:57Z"},{"id":"30137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Card","description":"The card control is a container for controls inside a form and is therefore exempt from accessibility assessment.","screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T13:57:01Z"},{"id":"32137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Check box","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-23T08:14:13Z"},{"id":"34137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Checkbox","description":"The user can specify a Boolean value by using this familiar control that is used in Graphical User Interface (GUI) for decades. The key properties for this control are Checked, Label, OnCheck, and OnUncheck.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=34137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896451523241268","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Do not use","recommendationCode":218650001,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:51Z"},{"id":"36137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62",