 correct format. The key properties for this control are Format, ValidationState, and OnChange.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=40137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896461143740102","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Avoid using if possible","recommendationCode":218650003,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:51Z"},{"id":"42137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Display form","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use with amendments","recommendationCode":218650002,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:51Z"},{"id":"44137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Drop down","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-27T13:46:49Z"},{"id":"46137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Dropdown","description":"A Drop down control conserves screen real estate, especially when the list contains a large number of choices. The control takes up only one line unless the user selects the chevron to reveal more choices. The key properties for this control are Items, ValidationState, and OnChange.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=46137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896487636268497","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Do not use","recommendationCode":218650001,"isInPreview":true,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:15Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:51Z"},{"id":"48137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Edit form","description":null,"scree