dOn":"2025-10-27T13:48:41Z"},{"id":"74137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Radio group","description":"A Radio group control is best used with only a few, mutually exclusive options. The key properties for this control are Items and DefaultSelectedItems.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=74137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896474153765214","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"76137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Rating","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-27T13:48:35Z"},{"id":"78137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Rating","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Can use","recommendationCode":218650000,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":true,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-27T13:51:01Z"},{"id":"7a137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Rich text editor","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2026-06-08T12:11:46Z"},{"id":"7c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Screen","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"7e137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Slider","description":"The user can indicate a value, between a minimum and a maximum value that you specify, by dragging the handle of a slider left-right or up-down, depending on the direction that you choose. The key properties for this control are OnChange, Value, Min, and Max.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=7e137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896477684574926","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"80137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Spinner","description":"Spinner control can be used to display loading scenarios where an action is in progress. This powerful control provides multiple display options suited for many scenarios. The key properties for this control are Label, Appearance, and SpinnerSize.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=80137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896478338231779","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"82137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Table","description":"The Table control is a modern responsive control that shows a set of data in a tabular or list format. The tabular format includes column headings for each displayed field and a footer that provides details about the dataset such as the record count. The list format presents the data in a single column and has three fields for each row. As an app maker, you have full control over what fields are added to the control including the order. Although all added fields are visible in the tabular format","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=82137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896505033472666","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T13:08:29Z"},{"id":"84137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Tabs or tab list","description":"A Tab is a navigation control, which can help users switch between different context within the app. You can add list of items to tabs or select a data table field for the list in tabs to appear. The key properties for this control are Items, OnChange, and OnSelect.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=84137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896479259553789","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"86137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Text","description":"Use this versatile Text control to display text, messages, and information on the app. The key properties for this control are Text, Size, and FontColor.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=86137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896480407794967","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"88137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Text input","description":"The user can specify data by typing into a Text input control. Depending on how you configure the app, that data might be added to a data source, used to calculate a temporary value, or incorporated in some other way. The key properties for this control are Value, Mode, and ValidationState.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=88137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896481327884178","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"8a137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Toggle","description":null,"screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":true,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-27T13:47:53Z"},{"id":"8c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62","name":"Toggle","description":"A toggle is a user interface element that has been created for modern graphical user interfaces (GUIs), but it functions in the same manner as a checkbox. The key properties for this control are Checked, Label, OnCheck, OnSelect, and OnUncheck.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=8c137234-4d69-f011-bec1-6045bd141b62&Timestamp=638896482314039486","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-07-25T11:48:16Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"f48793c7-cd6e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6","name":"Combobox","description":"A Combobox control lets you present collections of items for users to select. Configure single or multi-select mode via the SelectMultiple property. Key properties for this control are Items, DefaultSelectedItems, SelectedItems, SelectMultiple, and IsSearchable.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=f48793c7-cd6e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6&Timestamp=638896458633077883","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-08-01T11:50:58Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:51Z"},{"id":"0732e4e5-ce6e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6","name":"Link","description":"Use Link control to provide links that can be defined with accessibility compliance. The link opens in a new tab on your device. The key properties for this control are Text and URL.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=0732e4e5-ce6e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6&Timestamp=638896463804867203","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":false,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-08-01T11:58:55Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:44:52Z"},{"id":"5f9d6b47-d76e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6","name":"Information button","description":"Info button control enables developers to provide help and guidance to app users in an accessible way. The key properties for this control are Content, Icon Size, and OnSelect.","screenshotUrl":"/Image/download.aspx?Entity=ppcoe_canvascontrol&Attribute=ppcoe_screenshot&Id=5f9d6b47-d76e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6&Timestamp=638896499434058896","status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":null,"recommendationCode":null,"isInPreview":true,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-08-01T12:58:59Z","modifiedOn":"2025-08-01T12:59:03Z"},{"id":"9b89df77-d76e-f011-b4cc-7c1e520403f6","name":"Stream","description":"The Stream control in Power Apps lets you embed Microsoft Stream (on SharePoint) videos directly in your canvas app. Adding a Stream video in your app makes a smooth integration of videos hosted on Microsoft Stream in your canvas app. It also improves the user experience.","screenshotUrl":null,"status":"Active","statusCode":1,"recommendation":"Do not use","recommendationCode":218650001,"isInPreview":true,"isClassic":false,"isAccessible":false,"createdOn":"2025-08-01T13:00:24Z","modifiedOn":"2025-10-27T13:50:44Z"}]}